pam","Clorazepate"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":36,"q":"下列那一種鎮靜安眠藥物為時下青少年普遍所濫用之藥物，俗稱“FM2”","opts":["Flurazepam","Flunitrazepam","Diazepam","Triazolam"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":37,"q":"使用下列何者最可能產生氟離子（fluoride）造成的腎毒性？","opts":["Desflurane","Halothane","Nitrous oxide","Methoxyflurane"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":38,"q":"下列有關帕金森氏症震顫（tremor）的敘述，何者正確？","opts":["發生於休息靜止時，活化乙型交感神經受體會降低其發生","發生於休息靜止時，bromocriptine會增加其發生的機率","發生於意向性運動時，levodopa會增加其發生的機率","發生於休息靜止時，benztropine具有減少其發生的作用"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":39,"q":"長期使用phenytoin時會產生軟骨症（Osteomalacia），係由於下列那一種維生素代謝異常所造成的？","opts":["Vitamin B12","Vitamin D","Vitamin B6","Vitamin E"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":40,"q":"有關Prednisone的敘述，下列何者正確？","opts":["持續使用並不會增加IgG的分解速率","抑制腎、肝或心臟移植後的排斥作用","不具抗發炎作用","不會抑制腎上腺的功能"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":41,"q":"下列何種藥物不是經由COMT代謝？","opts":["Dobutamine","Isoproterenol","Norepinephrine","Terbutaline"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":42,"q":"下列何種藥物是經代謝成自由基（free radical）中間體而表現肝毒性？","opts":["Ethinylestradiol","Furosemide","Isoniazid","Pioglitazone"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":43,"q":"在正常生理情況下，何者屬於中性化合物？","opts":["Methylamine","Aniline","Diphenylamine","Pyridine"],"ans":"C","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":44,"q":"LogP＝Σπ(fragments)，其中P代表分配係數，π代表hydrophilic-lipophilic values。藥物分子每增加一個phenyl group，則π值增加多少？","opts":["0.5","1.0","1.5","2.0"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":45,"q":"下列何者可視為CH N 之等價異構物？2 2","opts":["CH OH3","CH CO2","CH CH2 2","CH NOH2"],"ans":"B","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":46,"q":"G-Protein-coupled receptors（GPCRs）屬於下列何種transmembrane（TM）domain之構造？","opts":["1-TM","2-TM","4-TM","7-TM"],"ans":"D","multi":false,"pts":null,"refs":[]},{"no":47,"q":"下列何種藥物會代謝成monoethylglycinexylidide而具有中樞毒性？","opts":["Benzocaine","Lidocaine","Mepivacaine","Tocainide"],"